            <ArticleTitle>Certification of health status and work ability of individuals with radicular pain syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>395-400</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Methods for diagnosis and determination of work ability of persons with radiculalgia were discussed following the literature and own experience. The author identified elements of neurological examinations, additional tests and consultations with other specialists which should best serve the purpose, and indicated the most common inaccuracies found in medical certificates.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
